{"id":"ced07f0d506d2066","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-fixed-point.md","title":"Fixed Point Lemma","display":"lem-fixed-point — Fixed Point Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-fixed-point","aliases":["92-lem-fixed-point"],"display":"lem-fixed-point — Fixed Point Lemma","depends_on":["[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-lem-self-reference-construction]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point — Fixed Point Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"eba4d14b343d9469\" href=\"?note=eba4d14b343d9469\" title=\"92-lem-self-reference-construction\">92-lem-self-reference-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\)</span> (formula with at most one distinguished free variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption supporting the standard diagonal construction)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\n\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\n\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对任意至多含指定自由变量<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>的公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，存在句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>，使<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>与把自身Gödel数的numeral无捕获地代入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>后的句子等价</li>\n<li>该“固定点”是句子在可证等价意义下的固定点</li>\n<li>它由可计算的对角代入函数、其二元内部图公式以及<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"eba4d14b343d9469\" href=\"?note=eba4d14b343d9469\" title=\"92-lem-self-reference-construction\">92-lem-self-reference-construction</a>得到；外部函数不能直接作为对象语言项使用</li>\n<li>不要与正规序数函数的序数固定点混淆；后者见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"55e4f62f29657a14\" href=\"?note=55e4f62f29657a14\" title=\"92-lem-fixed-point-exists\">92-lem-fixed-point-exists</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"6ad30e82597031a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":fa